Intetics Inc. , a global technology company providing custom software application development, distributed professional teams, software product quality assessment, and “all-things-digital” solutions, is seeking a highly skilled and experienced Senior SAP MM Consultant to join our dynamic team on a full-time basis.
Requirements

• 8+ years of experience in SAP MM functional consulting;

• Strong hands-on experience with SAP MM and SAP S/4HANA;

• Strong knowledge of Procurement, Inventory Management, and Logistics business processes;

• Experience with FI/CO integration;

• Experience preparing Functional Specifications (FS);

• Experience with testing, UAT, and business-user support;

• Italian language - B2+.

Responsibilities:

• Lead end-to-end SAP MM / SAP S/4HANA functional delivery for procurement, inventory management, and logistics processes, including workshops, blueprinting, configuration, testing, and go-live support.

• Collaborate with business stakeholders to translate requirements into SAP MM solutions that align with best practices and compliance.

• Manage FI/CO integration touchpoints to ensure accurate postings, reconciliations, and financial data integrity.

• Create, review, and maintain Functional Specifications (FS) for enhancements, interfaces, conversions, and reports with clear acceptance criteria.

• Define and execute testing strategies across unit, integration, and user acceptance testing; develop test plans and scripts; manage defects and validation with business users.

• Lead data migration and cutover activities, including data mapping, quality checks, rollback planning, and post-go-live stabilization.

• Deliver end-user training and produce user guides; provide ongoing post-implementation support and knowledge transfer.

• Mentor team members, support project governance, and ensure delivery quality, risk management, and adherence to security and compliance standards.

